    <string name="help_content"><![CDATA[
        <h3>Help & Support</h3>
        <p>Need assistance? We\'re here to help you shop smarter!</p>
        <h4>Common Questions:</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><b>How do Price Alerts work?</b> - Click the bell icon on any product. When the price hits your target, we\'ll send a push notification.</li>
            <li><b>How does Auto-Coupon work?</b> - Add items to your cart. Our AI automatically scans and applies the best working code at checkout.</li>
            <li><b>Is my data safe?</b> - Yes, we use 256-bit encryption for all your profile and preference data.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>For further support, email us at: <b>support@buysmart.ai</b></p>
    ]]></string>
