    <string name="terms_content"><![CDATA[
        <h3>Terms & Conditions</h3>
        <p>Welcome to BuySmart AI. By using our application, you agree to the following terms:</p>
        <h4>1. Use of Service</h4>
        <p>You agree to use BuySmart AI only for lawful purposes and in a way that does not infringe the rights of others.</p>
        <h4>2. Pricing Accuracy</h4>
        <p>While we strive for 100% accuracy, prices across e-commerce platforms change rapidly. BuySmart AI is not responsible for discrepancies between our predicted prices and actual checkout prices.</p>
        <h4>3. Account Security</h4>
        <p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account and password.</p>
        <h4>4. AI Recommendations</h4>
        <p>Our AI "Buy/Wait" recommendations are based on historical data patterns and should be used as a helpful guide, not as guaranteed financial advice.</p>
    ]]></string>
